    "body": "- The newest file was evicted instead of the oldest one. (#8089)\r\n-  Concurrent cache cleanup failed when multiple processes tried to remove the same file. (#7983)\r\n- Concurrent cleanup could occur in the gap between cache lookup and cache file usage, letting a build fail randomly.\r\n- The cleanup was essentially untested.\r\n- Cleanup testing was difficult due to file system state dependencies.\r\n\r\nRefactors the \"cleanup_cache()\" method into separate methods that can be called independently in tests.\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/8089\r\nCloses https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/7983\r\n\r\nTests were partly generated by Claude Haiku 4.5.\r\nBased on https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/8078",
    "closed_at": "2026-11-01T11:00:04Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/8090#discussion_r4405097986"
